title: Maybe arrange the sources|repopsitories in a tree.
pid: 0113f5d8-81d0-4b95-8de7-ef8a563a65e8
body: |2-
  So you can navigate to one of them faster.
  The tree would be up to the user.
  The flat kind would still be valid -- a flat list is a tree.
  This might interact badly with repository filtering.
